 "transcript": [
  "[action] Chen Fu sits and watches his sons.",
  "[action] (to Chen Fu) The sons return from their fields and join their father for dinner.",
  "[action] Chen Fu sleeps and is awakened by his sons' shouts.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu questions his eldest son.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"Tell me why you are crying out like that!\"",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"Is the harvest gone?\"",
  "[action] (to Chen Fu) The eldest son and his brother rush into the field.",
  "[action] Chen Fu enters his fields to find the cause of the commotion.",
  "[action] The second son stands at the head of a furrow.",
  "[action] The sons rush to the furrow where the second son stands.",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"He has cut the furrow!\"",
  "[action] (to Chen Fu) The eldest son steps into the furrow.",
  "Chen Fu (to the second son): \"Now what, fool!\"",
  "[silence] the eldest son says nothing.",
  "the second son (to Chen Fu): \"There is no furrow like it in all the rice land in the county.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son walks out in the furrow.",
  "[silence] (to Chen Fu) the second son says nothing.",
  "[action] Chen Fu looks at his sons.",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"The second son will never go back to his wife or his son again!\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu says nothing."
